      "writtenOn": "2021-11-16T00:49:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why not define a new interface for credentials that are used with a presentation session? e.g. IPresentationCredential or similar? That way, the interface is actually correct, rather than having most of the implementation return an error.\n\nAlternately: If we do stick with a single API for sessions and \"one-shots\", then I think a new error code is necessary. Else we\u0027re designing a broken abstraction -- not all code that calls an IIdentityCredential will necessarily know that it was a credential that\u0027s part of a session.",
